/-!
# `iotaFam`: the ι step's fire certificate at the verified mode

The gate (`iotaNoCert`, read-only); the level comparands (`recFireLevels`); case 3 (`iotaCase3At`); their
comparison with the constructor's levels (`lvlsEq?`, a refusal halts); the parameter comparands (`recFireArgs`)
against the major's leading arguments (`defEqList`); the constructor's type at its levels (`constTyAt`); the
telescope certificates (`iotaCertsFull`); the indices (`iotaIndexOk`). Callees with twin-side preconditions are
taken at the states of an invariant family `Q`, closed under each step's twin run.
-/

